 "remarks": "This updated 1BR+Den at Rolling Ridge gives you room to actually use - the den works as a home office, playroom, or guest room, and comes with its own ultra-convenient half bath, right alongside a fully updated Master Bath. The renovated kitchen shines with brand-new appliances, tile, and quartz countertops, while sliders off the dining room open to your own private balcony, a perfect spot to unwind. It's just a short flight of stairs up from the building entrance to your door. As an added bonus it also includes additional storage . Set on park-like grounds with an in-ground pool, paddle courts, and serene pond, Rolling Ridge offers plentiful, undesignated parking so guests always have a spot. Heat and hot water are included in the HOA fee, and the community is professionally managed with an active board. Convenient to local shopping, the train, and major highways.",
